# Dependencies. Standalone install: `yarn install` in this directory writes
# node_modules/ from the committed yarn.lock (GitHub Pages CI does exactly the
# same thing). Inside the noobscript monorepo a root install hoists into the
# repo-root node_modules instead, so whatever is here is disposable.
node_modules/

# Vite build output — `yarn build` regenerates it, and the Pages workflow uploads
# it as the deployment artifact. Never a source.
dist/

# Agent scratch (root AGENTS.md rule: throwaway scripts, probes and logs go in a
# repo-root Temp/, never OS temp).
Temp/

*.log
